Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","review_id":"rZ5EM9_o_i_sLemdB_tZUg","date":"2021-09-01T18:16:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9509646892547607,"text_excerpt":"This place is a solid little dive bar. I noticed the sign on the first night and wanted to check it out. I didn't end up going there until my last day and I regret not going sooner. The Frozen Irish Coffee was so good! It was perfect for a hot day and sooo much better than the daquiris that are all over Bourbon Street. They had happy hour specials but I wanted to get the souvenir cup!"},{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","review_id":"pymgqH1guTgALD30c2l6Kg","date":"2014-07-29T18:37:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9463327527046204,"text_excerpt":"This is a nice getaway from the flashy flashy business in the French Quarter. Came here because i read some reviews of frozen Irish coffee. Damn glad i did. Delicious. Plus, morning happy hour?! Yes please. Great bartenders, friendly non-tourist crowd. I'm a fan. Plus, po' boys served in the back!? How perfect."},{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","review_id":"OMTsGlAiOskG8QQdOxep-w","date":"2020-12-23T01:32:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9441818594932556,"text_excerpt":"During Covid (as of 12/22) this bar is serving to-go drinks! I had the frozen Irish coffee as well as the hot Irish coffee. Both were good. The frozen one (their specialty) tasted much better but was lacking strength. The hot coffee, on the other hand, was very very strong - but in a good way. Just prepare yourself. I also got the Jucifer - a wonderful draft IPA. Prices were reasonable for the quality! Around $5 per drink. The souvenir cup is cute and will become a staple water glass in my home. The staff members were kind. This is a nice spot to visit amongst all of the craziness in the Bourbon street area! Although I wouldn't categorize this as a NOLA must-see, it's a nice spot to grab ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","photo_id":"1xRza5zeR_QJXR7oe9ucSw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/1xRza5zeR_QJXR7oe9ucSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.861331045627594},{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","photo_id":"bANBmDgsYn48zcdvIUtL3A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bANBmDgsYn48zcdvIUtL3A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8460180163383484},{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","photo_id":"lw0ND97b-r2aojqA5ezB8Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lw0ND97b-r2aojqA5ezB8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8297913074493408},{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","photo_id":"Es7Z9XZLt2Q-bGVm_xQgSg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Es7Z9XZLt2Q-bGVm_xQgSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8243957161903381},{"business_id":"3qEjUW12sH6KOBm86ZDmTA","photo_id":"Mu92BZwWBCLqXWQ2kDNRHg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Mu92BZwWBCLqXWQ2kDNRHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.818828821182251}]},"notebook_case":null}
